# XCU times
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The special built-in utilities are described inside
# utilities/V3_chap02.html (the page utilities/times.html only redirects
# there), so anchors name V3_chap02.html and the .cov file accounts for
# the units by hand.

assertion  XCU.times.001
anchor     utilities/V3_chap02.html#DESCRIPTION/accumulated user and system times
class      required
says       times writes two lines in the form NmN.NNs NmN.NNs, the first for
           the shell's user and system times and the second for its
           children, and exits with status zero.
test       t/001-format.sh

assertion  XCU.times.003
anchor     utilities/V3_chap02.html#DESCRIPTION/accumulated user and system times
class      required
says       After a child process has used processor time, the second line of
           times shows non-zero accumulated time for children.
test       t/003-children.sh
